                    "output": "{'文件名': 'design.txt', '总行数': 44, '读取范围': '1-45', '实际读取行数': 44, '内容': \"第1行内容: # Aerospace Science Website Design Scheme\\n第2行内容: \\n第3行内容: ## 1. Overall Structure & Page Layout\\n第4行内容: - **Homepage**: Brief introduction, navigation, featured content highlights (latest news, recommended articles, image/video carousel).\\n第5行内容: - **Basic Knowledge Section**: Aerospace science principles, terminology, key concepts, with links to authoritative resources.\\n第6行内容: - **Historical Events Section**: Timeline of major aerospace milestones (e.g., China's manned space program, Apollo missions), each event with date, summary, and source.\\n第7行内容: - **Cutting-edge Technologies Section**: Latest aerospace innovations (e.g., X-59 Quesst, AAM, Roman Telescope), each with principle, application, and source.\\n第8行内容: - **Interactive Section**: Q&A, quizzes, DIY experiments, 3D visualization tools, discussion board.\\n第9行内容: - **Image/Video Gallery**: High-quality images and videos (NASA, CNSA, ESA), categorized by theme (spacewalks, planets, missions, Earth observation).\\n第10行内容: - **Footer**: Contact info, copyright, external links (NASA, SpaceX, CNSA, ESA), social media icons.\\n第11行内容: \\n第12行内容: ## 2. Navigation & Layout\\n第13行内容: - **Top Navigation Bar**: Fixed, includes logo (space-themed), links to all main sections, search bar (right-aligned), language switch (if needed).\\n第14行内容: - **Sidebar (optional for desktop)**: Quick links to popular topics, featured images/videos, recent Q&A.\\n第15行内容: - **Responsive Design**: Mobile-friendly, collapsible menu, image grid adapts to screen size.\\n第16行内容: \\n第17行内容: ## 3. Color Scheme & Visual Style\\n第18行内容: - **Primary Colors**: Technology Blue (#1A237E), Starfield Black (#121212), Accent White (#F5F5F5), Highlight Silver (#B0BEC5).\\n第19行内容: - **Button Style**: Rounded corners, gradient blue/black, hover effect (glow or shadow).\\n第20行内容: - **Font**: Sans-serif (Roboto, Arial), large headings, clear body text, consistent spacing.\\n第21行内容: - **Image/Video Layout**: Masonry grid or carousel, lightbox preview, captions with source info.\\n第22行内容: - **Background**: Subtle starfield or gradient, not distracting from content.\\n第23行内容: \\n第24行内容: ## 4. Interactive Features\\n第25行内容: - **Q&A Module**: Users can submit questions, see expert/AI answers, upvote useful answers.\\n第26行内容: - **Online Quiz**: Multiple-choice questions from materials.txt, instant feedback, score display.\\n第27行内容: - **DIY Experiments**: Step-by-step guides, downloadable templates, video demos.\\n第28行内容: - **3D Visualization**: Embed NASA's 'Asteroid Eyes' or similar tools, interactive exploration.\\n第29行内容: - **Discussion Board**: Threaded comments, moderation, links to NASA/CNSA forums.\\n第30行内容: - **Search Bar**: Real-time search for articles, images, events.\\n第31行内容: \\n第32行内容: ## 5. Reference & Style\\n第33行内容: - **Reference Website**: SpaceX official site (https://www.spacex.com/) for layout inspiration—clean, modern, tech-focused.\\n第34行内容: - **Language**: English (all UI and content).\\n第35行内容: - **Accessibility**: High contrast, alt text for images, keyboard navigation support.\\n第36行内容: \\n第37行内容: ## 6. File Structure & Maintenance\\n第38行内容: - Modular HTML/CSS/JS, easy to update content modules.\\n第39行内容: - All images/videos referenced via authoritative links, with fallback alt text.\\n第40行内容: - Clear comments in code for maintainability.\\n第41行内容: \\n第42行内容: ## 7. Summary\\n第43行内容: This design ensures a professional, authoritative, and engaging aerospace science website, suitable for educators and the general public. The structure is clear, content-rich, visually appealing, and highly interactive, with reference to SpaceX's modern style and NASA's authoritative resources.\\n第44行内容: \\n\"}",
